[22.415181, "o", "deny\r\nA rule of this project’s record refuses a write at src/billing/invoice.ts while it stands.\r\n“Keep money as integer cents” — refuses a write at src/billing · \r\n01a1131c-9e44-7000-be58-13ddb508d383 · accepted by mnid:fa54de9e (a person)\r\nThe rule opens with `mnema show 01a1131c-9e44-7000-be58-13ddb508d383`; changing it is a \r\ndecision for whoever recorded it.\r\nThis refusal covers the editing tools, not the shell: a write to a path a rule governs made \r\nthrough the shell goes round the rule.\r\n"]
[24.818079, "o", "\u001b[2m# the refusal is a signed fact of the record, like the rule it cites\u001b[0m\r\n"]
